    "text": "ふう、びっくりした\r\nこんな仕掛けのあるプールだったのか……甜花は大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "て、甜花は、かかんなかった……\r\nでも、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……にへへ……\r\nプロデューサーさん、水と一緒にいなくなって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010280,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……笑っちゃって、ご、ごめんなさい……\r\nでも……でも……にへへへへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そんなに笑うか……？\r\nでも……うん、良い笑顔だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010290,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……\r\n良い……笑顔……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、さっきまで固くなってたのが嘘みたいじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010300,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、そう……かな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010310,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "水、ばしゃってなったプロデューサーさん……\r\n面白くって……に、にへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010320,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、思い出したら……\r\nまた、楽しくなってきちゃった……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事の時も、そんなふうに楽しいことを見つければいいんだ\r\nみんなが見たいのは、甜花の心からの笑顔だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010330,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nそれなら甜花にも……できる、かな……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010340,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "水着、やっぱり……ちょっと、恥ずかしいけど……\r\n楽しいこと、できないのも、やだ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015005010350,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それに……プロデューサーさんがいれば、\r\nきっと楽しいこと……見つかる……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500501/2015005010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n俺も、甜花が仕事を楽しめるように手伝うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
